<title>NEW ZEALAND: Brierley full year result due Sept 4.</title>
<headline>Brierley full year result due Sept 4.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brierley Investments Ltd said on Tuesday its full year results announcement would be made on September 4.</p>
<p>The company's AGM is to be held on November 13.</p>
<p>The 1997 final dividend will have a record date of October 31, and a payable date of November 12.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
<p>e-mail wellington.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
